VERDICT: NET-NEUTRAL. No pansier model statistically distinguishable from the leader in either
regime. Flat scatter, no monotonic trend (A_2000 worst at 0.9507). Keep the 0.9548/0.9549 leader
deployed; no 5k/10k scale-up (gated on improving trend, which is absent). Pansier is a general
Old Occitan lexicon, not medical-treatise text -> adds no manuscript-relevant signal (consistent
with §6.5.24: the lever is distinct IN-DOMAIN medical text, not distinctness alone).

